                                "sense_id": "1ce22faf-3aa0-3cef-9411-666a4464623e",
                                "text": "Why he gets Mony, Applause, Vindications, Apologys; but you must not take him for one of your Downright Sillytons, that, does not know whether he goes on his Head or his Heels."
                            },
